---
description: Route every Cleanora task through minimal, phase-scoped context.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/ai/context-router.md` first.

- Load the repository-local current phase pointer, active phase artifacts, and only the smallest matching rules.
- Normally use three to six context files.
- Expand context only for a concrete dependency.
- Summarize loaded context in at most five bullets.
- Never preload all documents or ordinary future phase specifications.
- Never paste full documents into responses.
- Keep work within one active phase or one defect.
- Treat missing canonical context as a gap; do not invent behavior or inspect another project.
